WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:42.852
[Weightless Synth-Pop Intro — 10,000-Foot Cabin Chime]

00:00:42.852 --> 00:00:47.500
The engine hums a steady beat

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:52.456
Thirty thousand tired feet

00:00:53.217 --> 00:00:57.800
Above the clouds, a sea of white

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:02.500
Escaping from the endless night

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:08.500
Your hand in mine, a steady grace

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:14.373
The only anchor in this place

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:19.500
You let me lean against your side

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:24.536
With nothing left to run or hide

00:01:27.117 --> 00:01:33.679
And for the first time in so long, I can breathe

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:46.000
A quiet promise, I believe

00:01:48.445 --> 00:01:51.800
Your shoulder is my only home right now

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:55.000
A silent, true, and sacred vow

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.500
This sanctuary in the sky

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:00.813
Beneath a calm and endless eye

00:02:00.893 --> 00:02:03.800
Is all I need to feel okay

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:07.498
And chase the lingering fog away

00:02:10.576 --> 00:02:15.500
I think about the static sound

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:20.500
On that unholy, hollow ground

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:26.165
I think about the pouring rain

00:02:26.265 --> 00:02:32.000
The endless fear, the burning pain

00:02:33.449 --> 00:02:38.000
But then I feel you squeeze my hand

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:41.475
And I begin to understand

00:02:41.575 --> 00:02:46.500
The storm has passed, the war is done

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.882
A quiet battle has been won

00:02:54.886 --> 00:03:01.211
And for the first time in so long, I can breathe

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:14.000
A quiet promise, I believe

00:03:16.184 --> 00:03:19.500
Your shoulder is my only home right now

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.800
A silent, true, and sacred vow

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:25.500
This sanctuary in the sky

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.509
Beneath a calm and endless eye

00:03:28.609 --> 00:03:31.500
Is all I need to feel okay

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.631
And chase the lingering fog away

00:03:34.631 --> 00:04:12.000
[Hopeful Arpeggiated Synthesizer Solo]

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:20.000
My anchor...

00:04:20.000 --> 00:05:12.000
[Warm Cabin Drone and Gentle Synth Pad]

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Safe... Thank you...

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:46.000
[Peaceful Synth Outro Fades to Silence]
